🩺 Medly – AI-Powered Healthcare Intelligence Platform
 **AI-Powered Healthcare Platform: Scan. Understand. Eat Right. Heal Better.**
📌 Overview

Medly is an AI-powered healthcare platform that converts medical documents such as prescriptions, lab reports, and medical images into clear, structured, and easy-to-understand insights using advanced multimodal AI.

The system uses Streamlit for the interface and Google Gemini AI for intelligent analysis to help users understand their health reports, detect possible conditions, and receive personalized guidance.

The goal is to improve healthcare accessibility by simplifying complex medical information into actionable insights for patients and caregivers.

🚀 Features
🧠 AI-powered analysis of prescriptions, lab reports, and medical images
📊 Disease detection with severity classification (Mild, Moderate, High)
💊 Automated digital prescription extraction and tracking
🧪 Biomarker comparison with standard medical ranges
🥗 Personalized diet recommendations based on health conditions
⏱️ Smart medication and daily health scheduling system